[
 {
  "i": 0,
  "style": "OP11 Lyrics",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Until I can reach the sky,"
 },
 {
  "i": 1,
  "style": "OP11 Lyrics",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I believe, until the next tomorrow, hey"
 },
 {
  "i": 2,
  "style": "OP11 Lyrics",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Chasing and being chased on top of Mobius' ring."
 },
 {
  "i": 3,
  "style": "OP11 Credits",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\pos(1040,108)}Translation\\NFunimation"
 },
 {
  "i": 4,
  "style": "OP11 Credits",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\pos(1040,195)}Soundtracking\\NHalee"
 },
 {
  "i": 5,
  "style": "OP11 Credits",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\pos(1040,298)}Quality-checking\\Nalasta"
 },
 {
  "i": 6,
  "style": "OP11 Lyrics",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Getting closer and facing forward, hey I want to share your style."
 },
 {
  "i": 7,
  "style": "OP11 Credits",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\pos(1050,110)}Editing\\NSewil\\NFeeso"
 },
 {
  "i": 8,
  "style": "OP11 Credits",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\pos(1050,252)}Infoboxes\\NBernieCrane"
 },
 {
  "i": 9,
  "style": "OP11 Credits",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\pos(1050,350)}Formatting\\NSewil"
 },
 {
  "i": 10,
  "style": "OP11 Credits",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\pos(1050,460)}Edit-checking\\NGalaxy 9000"
 },
 {
  "i": 11,
  "style": "OP11 Lyrics",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It begins, it expands, this flavor that exceeds imagination"
 },
 {
  "i": 12,
  "style": "OP11 Lyrics",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I feel so good throughout my body, I will become free, oh yeah"
 },
 {
  "i": 13,
  "style": "OP11 Lyrics",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Share the music, even if it's far."
 },
 {
  "i": 14,
  "style": "OP11 Lyrics",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Share the one dream, by telling each other."
 },
 {
  "i": 15,
  "style": "OP11 Lyrics",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Share the good times and laugh."
 },
 {
  "i": 16,
  "style": "OP11 Lyrics",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'll keep going until I can reach the sky."
 },
 {
  "i": 17,
  "style": "OP11 Lyrics",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Let's overcome it now, I believe in the next tomorrow yeah yeah..."
 },
 {
  "i": 18,
  "style": "OP11 Lyrics",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You were waiting there on the other side of the invisible wall."
 },
 {
  "i": 19,
  "style": "OP11 Lyrics",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'll be there soon, I believe in one world yeah yeah..."
 },
 {
  "i": 20,
  "style": "Captions",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(315,0)\\pos(1051.667,543.333)}Sabaody Archipelago\\NGrove #41"
 },
 {
  "i": 21,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Duval-sama."
 },
 {
  "i": 22,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What's taking Young Master Straw Hat\\Nand the others so long?"
 },
 {
  "i": 23,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Maybe they're busy with\\Nthe people chasing ‘em?"
 },
 {
  "i": 24,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I heard the port's in a real uproar!"
 },
 {
  "i": 25,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Then that's all the more\\Nreason to stay sharp!"
 },
 {
  "i": 26,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We don't want any idiots showing up\\Nand taking off with this ship!"
 },
 {
  "i": 27,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Guard it well until the\\Ncoating craftsman arrives!"
 },
 {
  "i": 28,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Rosy Life Riders!"
 },
 {
  "i": 29,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Yes Duva-some!"
 },
 {
  "i": 30,
  "style": "Captions",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(667,617)\\pos(1038.333,555)}Grove #1\\NAuction House"
 },
 {
  "i": 31,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You still haven't caught them?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 32,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Admiral Kizaru is currently pursuing them"
 },
 {
  "i": 33,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "so it should only be a matter of time!"
 },
 {
  "i": 34,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Please have patience!"
 },
 {
  "i": 35,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You pathetic dimwitted dogs!"
 },
 {
  "i": 36,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Not only did they do this\\Nto my father and brother..."
 },
 {
  "i": 37,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "but they also let all of our slaves escape!"
 },
 {
  "i": 38,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What do they take the blood\\Nof this world's Creators for?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 39,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "When I get my hands on them..."
 },
 {
  "i": 40,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'm going to put them through\\Na living hell so horrible..."
 },
 {
  "i": 41,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "that they'll crawl on the ground\\Nand beg for forgiveness!"
 },
 {
  "i": 42,
  "style": "Captions",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(534,300)\\pos(1051.667,541.667)}Grove #13\\NShakki's Rip-off Bar"
 },
 {
  "i": 43,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'm suddenly feeling uneasy."
 },
 {
  "i": 44,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I hope Luffy-chin and the others are okay..."
 },
 {
  "i": 45,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What's with you Camie?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 46,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Don't say worrisome stuff like that!"
 },
 {
  "i": 47,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "But..."
 },
 {
  "i": 48,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "They're strong.\\NThere's nothing to worry about Camie..."
 },
 {
  "i": 49,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I hope you're right..."
 },
 {
  "i": 50,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "They're up against a navy admiral."
 },
 {
  "i": 51,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Not even Monkey-chan's group\\Nstands a chance strength-wise."
 },
 {
  "i": 52,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The seas ahead will be rough."
 },
 {
  "i": 53,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Giant waves they've never\\Nseen before are coming."
 },
 {
  "i": 54,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "They mustn't let these waves do them in."
 },
 {
  "i": 55,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "There. Can you hear it?"
 },
 {
  "i": 56,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Little by little the tide of\\Nthe times is beginning to change."
 },
 {
  "i": 57,
  "style": "Title",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(834,000)}Adventure on the Island of Women"
 },
 {
  "i": 58,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Meanwhile, Monkey D. Luffy\\Nafter being ejected"
 },
 {
  "i": 59,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "from Sabaody Archipelago\\Nby Bartholomew Kuma."
 },
 {
  "i": 60,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Damn it!"
 },
 {
  "i": 61,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Zoro! Nami!"
 },
 {
  "i": 62,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Usopp! Sanji! Chopper!"
 },
 {
  "i": 63,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Robin! Franky! Brook!"
 },
 {
  "i": 64,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Where did you send all my friends?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 65,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Where did you guys disappear to?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 66,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "That bear-like Warlord\\Nof the Sea is gonna pay!"
 },
 {
  "i": 67,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "How far am I gonna fly anyway?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 68,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Perhaps, instead of disappearing, they were all sent flying like this too?"
 },
 {
  "i": 69,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'm dead if I fall into the ocean..."
 },
 {
  "i": 70,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'm hungry too..."
 },
 {
  "i": 71,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "But... I'm feeling sleepy..."
 },
 {
  "i": 72,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'm alive..."
 },
 {
  "i": 73,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I don't think me being rubber\\Nis why I'm still alive..."
 },
 {
  "i": 74,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "But what's this bear paw-looking thing?"
 },
 {
  "i": 75,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I just hope the others\\Nwere saved the same way..."
 },
 {
  "i": 76,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Anyway, I gotta get back!"
 },
 {
  "i": 77,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Where is this place..."
 },
 {
  "i": 78,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "...and which way is Sabaody Archipelago?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 79,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Oh yeah!"
 },
 {
  "i": 80,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I have my Vivre Card!"
 },
 {
  "i": 81,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Good thing we all got one!"
 },
 {
  "i": 82,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Alright! I gotta go back!\\NI gotta get back there!"
 },
 {
  "i": 83,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'm sure I'll see everyone again!"
 },
 {
  "i": 84,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "That way, huh?"
 },
 {
  "i": 85,
  "style": "Flashbacks",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Everyone focus on escaping!"
 },
 {
  "i": 86,
  "style": "Flashbacks",
  "name": "",
  "text": "As we are now we can't beat these guys!"
 },
 {
  "i": 87,
  "style": "Flashbacks",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Just get out of here!"
 },
 {
  "i": 88,
  "style": "Flashbacks",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You can think things over after you're safe!"
 },
 {
  "i": 89,
  "style": "Flashbacks",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Go!"
 },
 {
  "i": 90,
  "style": "Flashbacks",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What's wrong with me?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 91,
  "style": "Flashbacks",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I couldn't save even one of my friends...!"
 },
 {
  "i": 92,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Ouch!"
 },
 {
  "i": 93,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Actually, that doesn't hurt."
 },
 {
  "i": 94,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "but oh there's something in the way..."
 },
 {
  "i": 95,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Still..."
 },
 {
  "i": 96,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "...the card is pointing this way..."
 },
 {
  "i": 97,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Alright!"
 },
 {
  "i": 98,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(250,250)}Giant Pistol!"
 },
 {
  "i": 99,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "N-No good..."
 },
 {
  "i": 100,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'm out of strength..."
 },
 {
  "i": 101,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Sanji! Food!"
 },
 {
  "i": 102,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Oh wait he's not here..."
 },
 {
  "i": 103,
  "style": "Note",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(250,250)}\"Stomach rumble\""
 },
 {
  "i": 104,
  "style": "Note",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(250)}\"Stomach rumble\"\\N\"Stomach rumble\"\\N\"Stomach rumble\""
 },
 {
  "i": 105,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Thanks for the food!"
 },
 {
  "i": 106,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "This brings back memories..."
 },
 {
  "i": 107,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Back when Grandpa would throw me\\Ninto the jungle when I was a kid!"
 },
 {
  "i": 108,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I don't wanna remember that."
 },
 {
  "i": 109,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Aren't these Laughing Mushrooms?"
 },
 {
  "i": 110,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Yeah! This is perfect for times like this!"
 },
 {
  "i": 111,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Now I'm having fun!"
 },
 {
  "i": 112,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Even though I'm all alone!"
 },
 {
  "i": 113,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "There are some weird ones over here too!"
 },
 {
  "i": 114,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Now I'm feeling mad!"
 },
 {
  "i": 115,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Laughing Mushrooms! Laughing Mushrooms!"
 },
 {
  "i": 116,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Oh! There are weird mushrooms here too!"
 },
 {
  "i": 117,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Crying Mushrooms!"
 },
 {
  "i": 118,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Marguerite! Marguerite!"
 },
 {
  "i": 119,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Over here!"
 },
 {
  "i": 120,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What is it Sweetpea?"
 },
 {
  "i": 121,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What do you make of this?"
 },
 {
  "i": 122,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Of what?"
 },
 {
  "i": 123,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What do you suppose this is?"
 },
 {
  "i": 124,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Wh-What the...?! This is a person!"
 },
 {
  "i": 125,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Is it someone from the village?"
 },
 {
  "i": 126,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I don't know."
 },
 {
  "i": 127,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "There are so many mushrooms\\Ngrowing out of her body..."
 },
 {
  "i": 128,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "This is it."
 },
 {
  "i": 129,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Look! She ate this mushroom!"
 },
 {
  "i": 130,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "A Parasite Mushroom."
 },
 {
  "i": 131,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "When eaten mushrooms\\Ngrow out of your body!"
 },
 {
  "i": 132,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "This is bad!"
 },
 {
  "i": 133,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "If we don't do something the mushrooms\\Nwill sap away her vitality and kill her!"
 },
 {
  "i": 134,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "So it's a race against time!"
 },
 {
  "i": 135,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Aphelandra! Carry her to the village!"
 },
 {
  "i": 136,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Okay!"
 },
 {
  "i": 137,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "To the village it is!"
 },
 {
  "i": 138,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Let's hurry!"
 },
 {
  "i": 139,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We have an urgent patient!"
 },
 {
  "i": 140,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Hey! Down in front! I can't see!"
 },
 {
  "i": 141,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What happened to her?!\\NShe's covered in mushrooms!"
 },
 {
  "i": 142,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Have you seen her in the village before?"
 },
 {
  "i": 143,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "No never..."
 },
 {
  "i": 144,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Hey who is she?"
 },
 {
  "i": 145,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The mushrooms are covering her face..."
 },
 {
  "i": 146,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Where do you think she came from?"
 },
 {
  "i": 147,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Is she even alive?"
 },
 {
  "i": 148,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "She ate a Parasite Mushroom."
 },
 {
  "i": 149,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What should we do Belladonna?"
 },
 {
  "i": 150,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "They come off when pulled\\Nso pull them out. All of them."
 },
 {
  "i": 151,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "They come off?"
 },
 {
  "i": 152,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "They really do!"
 },
 {
  "i": 153,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "But some of the roots are left behind!"
 },
 {
  "i": 154,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'll get rid of them afterward\\Nso don't worry about the roots."
 },
 {
  "i": 155,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You've certainly brought\\Na strange one home Marguerite."
 },
 {
  "i": 156,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Ouch! Hot! Hot!"
 },
 {
  "i": 157,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Hold on Belladonna! What are you doing?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 158,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "This is the only way to keep\\Nthem from growing back."
 },
 {
  "i": 159,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "But isn't that a little excessive?"
 },
 {
  "i": 160,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "She passed out again!"
 },
 {
  "i": 161,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Still, she was covered in injuries\\Nbefore she was covered in mushrooms."
 },
 {
  "i": 162,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Really?"
 },
 {
  "i": 163,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "They seem like marks\\Nfrom a tremendous battle."
 },
 {
  "i": 164,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We'll need to treat her wounds too."
 },
 {
  "i": 165,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I hate to ask Marguerite"
 },
 {
  "i": 166,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "but could you go wash her off in the river?"
 },
 {
  "i": 167,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "O-Okay! Sure!"
 },
 {
  "i": 168,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It sounds like she's not from\\Nthis village after all Sweetpea."
 },
 {
  "i": 169,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Yeah..."
 },
 {
  "i": 170,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Huh? Look here!"
 },
 {
  "i": 171,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What's wrong?"
 },
 {
  "i": 172,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
