  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You must be crazy to jump from way up there!"
 },
 {
  "i": 354,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I was ready to die!"
 },
 {
  "i": 355,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It's a miracle we're still alive!"
 },
 {
  "i": 356,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Really?"
 },
 {
  "i": 357,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Stay away!"
 },
 {
  "i": 358,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I've heard that you men have a virus!"
 },
 {
  "i": 359,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Do all men suddenly grow fat?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 360,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I don't have any kind of virus"
 },
 {
  "i": 361,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "and it'll be a pain to explain, so let's just say all men suddenly grow fat."
 },
 {
  "i": 362,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Anyway was there something\\Nin my torn-up pants pockets?"
 },
 {
  "i": 363,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Is this it?"
 },
 {
  "i": 364,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "This is it! This is it! What a relief!"
 },
 {
  "i": 365,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I wouldn't know what to do without this!"
 },
 {
  "i": 366,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Thanks for holding onto it!"
 },
 {
  "i": 367,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "L-Let go!"
 },
 {
  "i": 368,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Oh what a relief!"
 },
 {
  "i": 369,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "There was something written\\Non it so I figured..."
 },
 {
  "i": 370,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Here look!"
 },
 {
  "i": 371,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "How odd! It looks like it's moving!"
 },
 {
  "i": 372,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "A bunch of stuff happened"
 },
 {
  "i": 373,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "and all my friends went flying\\Nthrough the sky in different directions."
 },
 {
  "i": 374,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "But thanks to these pieces of paper"
 },
 {
  "i": 375,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "we can all get together again!"
 },
 {
  "i": 376,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "They're all tough you see!"
 },
 {
  "i": 377,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Oh I've been thanking you non-stop!"
 },
 {
  "i": 378,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Is there anything I can do for you?"
 },
 {
  "i": 379,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Could you take out your family\\Njewels so I can see them then?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 380,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I told you they don't come off!"
 },
 {
  "i": 381,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Put the sword away!"
 },
 {
  "i": 382,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Who are these \"friends\" of yours?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 383,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Oh I'm a pirate!"
 },
 {
  "i": 384,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Do you know what a pirate is?"
 },
 {
  "i": 385,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You're a pirate?"
 },
 {
  "i": 386,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "This land's empress is a pirate too."
 },
 {
  "i": 387,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Really?"
 },
 {
  "i": 388,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Then she has a women-only pirate group?"
 },
 {
  "i": 389,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Are they strong?"
 },
 {
  "i": 390,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "That's a foolish question!"
 },
 {
  "i": 391,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The most elite warriors of this land\\Nride aboard her pirate ship!"
 },
 {
  "i": 392,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "They're very strong!"
 },
 {
  "i": 393,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Everyone here looks up to the Snake Princess!"
 },
 {
  "i": 394,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "She's strong noble and the most\\Nbeautiful woman in the world!"
 },
 {
  "i": 395,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The Pirate Empress Boa Hancock!"
 },
 {
  "i": 396,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "This land is closely protected\\Nby her and her two sisters!"
 },
 {
  "i": 397,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Oh no! The Snake Princess's ship is nearby!"
 },
 {
  "i": 398,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "This is bad!"
 },
 {
  "i": 399,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We need to end the\\Nincident with the man quickly!"
 },
 {
  "i": 400,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Kikyo..."
 },
 {
  "i": 401,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It looks like the man jumped\\Ninto the jungle after all!"
 },
 {
  "i": 402,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Warriors! To the jungle!"
 },
 {
  "i": 403,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Kill the man and rescue Marguerite!"
 },
 {
  "i": 404,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The Snake Princess has returned!"
 }
]